                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The United States Congress authorized the transfer of two destroyer escorts to
                    Uruguay under Public Law 146, approved September 15, 1951; for text, see 65
                    Stat. 322. The sale of the ships was effected on November 15. Pertinent
                    documents are in Department of State decimal file 733.5-MAP.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
